{"categories":[],"data_as_of":"2026-09-18T02:47:24Z","description":"本站近 30 天收录的 AI Agent 相关证据与变化。","evidence":[{"associated_observations":1,"id":"evt_cdd4e91118152304d7e2db3b877cafb1ba5443e23d21c65d65795bc176762e3c","internal_url":"/posts/20260918-arxiv-coding-agents-with-an-obstacle-aware-harness-for-s-0-e738f009e4/","observation_id":"obs_e738f009e4d5f367618176a26eabaec69353ea1a79bbfad285810f08d52839b8","published_at":"2026-09-17T17:59:58Z","related_reports":[],"relation":"original","source":"arxiv","summary":"该研究评估了代码生成式机器人在必须避开障碍物的任务中的安全表现，发现现有系统在规划时倾向于只关注任务完成而忽视避障。通过将操控分解为路径阶段和接触阶段，提出了名为 SafeHarness 的框架，分别为路径规划和接触执行配备障碍感知模块，使安全约束能够被优先考虑。","title":"Coding Agents with an Obstacle-Aware Harness for Safe Robot Manipulation"},{"associated_observations":1,"id":"evt_ea1df0c583d9418456f0676cdbb2be67990be33365696a0bf0a170d9cd3b09bf","internal_url":"/posts/20260918-blogs_podcasts-reduce-time-to-hire-for-quality-candidates-with-ai-0-09178a0dd9/","observation_id":"obs_09178a0dd908c4320418a4232a2f6a91336757a13ab109e2baa94092130564aa","published_at":"2026-09-17T17:55:20Z","related_reports":[],"relation":"original","source":"blogs_podcasts","summary":"这是一款利用 AI 代理进行面试与评估的招聘系统，能够在大量应聘者中统一、数据化地完成筛选并生成详细的评分报告。","title":"Reduce time-to-hire for quality candidates with AI-powered Amazon Connect Talent"},{"associated_observations":1,"id":"evt_48e90b269098ba004425acd32d2b74949df316e6bbaef7f65cb3516f2b7b55f4","internal_url":"/posts/20260918-hacker_news-show-hn-aclif-agent-cli-framework-one-grammar-cano-6-3ce988e640/","observation_id":"obs_3ce988e640b860844f9d62aab1ac925aba1458107f4d70509375f34b917e8225","published_at":"2026-09-17T16:48:17Z","related_reports":[],"relation":"original","source":"hacker_news","summary":"当前只保存了标题与来源元数据，未抓取外链全文。请以原始来源和 Hacker News 讨论为准。","title":"Show HN: Aclif – Agent CLI framework: one grammar, canonical names across SaaS"},{"associated_observations":1,"id":"evt_5ddb4b9df3f6a9be4b1e30eafd82ef6cb0b1db1bb0098fd8ba093ed9b78ace4a","internal_url":"/posts/20260